===== PHASE 10 — addendum: stale-artifact hazard when cargo package fails =====
existing .crate on disk (from the last successful run):
-rw-r--r--@ 1 stevemorin  wheel  2594 Sep 10 08:22 target/package/rsguard-0.1.0.crate
now make the tree dirty so cargo package fails:
cargo package exit=101

to proceed despite this and include the uncommitted changes, pass the `--allow-dirty` flag
the .crate from the PREVIOUS run is still present and would be extracted by an unguarded check:
-rw-r--r--@ 1 stevemorin  wheel  2594 Sep 10 08:22 target/package/rsguard-0.1.0.crate
[{"kind":["bin"],"name":"rsguard"},{"kind":["bin"],"name":"rsguard-serve"},{"kind":["lib"],"name":"rsguard"}]
